    <string name="how_to_score">How to Score a Baseball Game</string>
    <string name="how_to_start">First, add both teams that are playing in today\'s game. Then look at the lineups posted by both teams and add each player to their corresponding spot in the lineup. To update a batter\'s scoring, select the corresponding inning column and enter how they did.</string>


